Pronunciation audio — public/audio/
  Generated with VOICEVOX (https://voicevox.hiroshiba.jp) by scripts/generate-audio.ts.
  Female voice: VOICEVOX:春日部つむぎ (terms: https://tsumugi-official.studio.site/rule)
  Male voice:   VOICEVOX:青山龍星 (terms: https://www.virvoxproject.com/voicevoxの利用規約)
  Voice details: public/audio/SOURCES.json

Speech model — public/models/
  Trained (ml/) on speech generated with VOICEVOX (https://voicevox.hiroshiba.jp), from the
  voices whose terms allow it (see ml/VOICES.md for the check and the terms of each):
  VOICEVOX:四国めたん, VOICEVOX:ずんだもん, VOICEVOX:春日部つむぎ, VOICEVOX:雨晴はう,
  VOICEVOX:波音リツ, VOICEVOX:冥鳴ひまり, VOICEVOX:九州そら, VOICEVOX:剣崎雌雄, VOICEVOX:No.7,
  VOICEVOX:櫻歌ミコ, VOICEVOX:小夜/SAYO, VOICEVOX:†聖騎士 紅桜†, VOICEVOX:春歌ナナ,
  VOICEVOX:中国うさぎ, VOICEVOX:栗田まろん, VOICEVOX:あいえるたん, VOICEVOX:満別花丸,
  VOICEVOX:中部つるぎ, VOICEVOX:ユーレイちゃん, VOICEVOX:東北ずん子, VOICEVOX:東北きりたん,
  VOICEVOX:東北イタコ, VOICEVOX:あんこもん, VOICEVOX:夜語トバリ, VOICEVOX:暁記ミタマ.
  Only the trained weights are included, not the generated speech.

Stroke-order data — src/lib/data/kanjivg/
  Derived from KanjiVG (https://kanjivg.tagaini.net), copyright (C) Ulrich Apel
  and contributors. Licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). See src/lib/data/kanjivg/LICENSE.

Memory hints and drawings — src/lib/data/tofugu/, src/lib/data/mnemonics.ts
  The memory hints and drawings for the basic hiragana and katakana are from
  Tofugu's Learn Hiragana Book (https://www.tofugu.com/japanese/learn-hiragana-book/)
  and Learn Katakana Book (https://www.tofugu.com/japanese/learn-katakana-book/),
  copyright Tofugu, used with credit. The drawings were traced into SVG by
  scripts/tofugu-drawings.ts; the Dutch hints are translations.

Fonts — public/fonts/
  Japanese fonts from the Google Fonts repository (https://github.com/google/fonts),
  subsetted to kana by scripts/subset-fonts.ts. Licensed under the SIL Open Font
  License 1.1, except Kosugi Maru (Apache License 2.0). Licence texts are in
  public/fonts/licenses/. Interface font: Inter (SIL OFL 1.1, via @fontsource-variable/inter).

Photos — public/photos/
  From Unsplash (https://unsplash.com), used under the Unsplash License
  (https://unsplash.com/license). Photographer credits: public/photos/credits.json
  and the in-app Credits page.

Sound effects — public/sfx/
  From Freesound (https://freesound.org), CC0 1.0, plus a few effects generated
  for kana (also CC0). The koto notes are cut from "Koto performance.ogg" by
  Torsodog on Wikimedia Commons, CC BY 3.0
  (https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Koto_performance.ogg).
  Per-file sources: public/sfx/manifest.json and scripts/sfx.json.
